cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "synthetic-resdac-claims (synthmed)"
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite it using the
  metadata below. The companion synthetic dataset is archived on
  Zenodo at the DOI given under `identifiers`.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Belakurski
    given-names: Pavel
    alias: ChilliPenguin
    affiliation: Northwestern University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4271-9728"
  - family-names: Chumack
    given-names: Mark
    affiliation: University of Massachusetts Amherst
